{"title":"2009 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2009 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">2010 CEMC Pascal #2</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2009 CEMC Cayley Problems (page does not exist)\">2010 CEMC Cayley #2</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The graph shows the number of hours Deepit worked overa three day period. What is the total number of hours that he worked on Saturday and Sunday?\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>(bar graph: each tick mark up represents 1 and goes up to 6, but only 2, 4, and 6 are labeled. Friday is 2 tick marks up, Saturday is 6 tick marks up, and Sunday is 4 tick marks up.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/2/53292457a9398497bddea5407cece7474b6be580.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 2 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 4 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 6 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 8 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the bar graph, Deepit worked <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours on Saturday and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours on Sunday. In total, this would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/e/efebea28dd65f10f1f02ad3b0e67aedbdf1aac36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 + 4 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(E) } 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"130\" height=\"30\" /> hours.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Lgnjqr28Lnk?si=DNCaR-6iJx47HHPT&amp;t=30\">https://youtu.be/Lgnjqr28Lnk?si=DNCaR-6iJx47HHPT&amp;t=30</a> (also includes problems 1 and 3-10)\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Pascal\" title=\"2009 CEMC Pascal\">2009 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2009 CEMC Pa